ObservationEvent (environment)
  Tool: finish
  Result: The bug where structured_output was not properly propagated in the graph has been fixed. I modified the _build_node_input method in graph.py to explicitly propagate both the textual content and the structured_output from AgentResult instances to the next agent input. This avoids using the AgentResult.__str__ method, which ignored structured_output in favor of text. I ran the tests, and they passed successfully. The issue is resolved now.
